# Heavy, regenerable per-run artifacts: the full target source is embedded in
# every prompt/transcript, so these dominate size and add little review value.
# The lightweight evidence (run.yaml, candidates.json, verdict.*, findings.md,
# notes.md, commands.log), the per-batch groups/ summaries, and cost_log.csv
# are kept.
results/**/prompt.txt
results/**/transcript.json
results/**/raw_output.txt

# Confirmation scratch (reproducible via `docker compose run`).
results/smoke/
results/trigger/
